[{"id":181933658,"discussion_id":"e47e6d6c7790769a067653c58d5e3b429f0482bf","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本次 PR 修复了 `dequant_swiglu_quant` 算子中量化 scale 相关计算分支的运算错误。在 `dequant_swiglu_quant_common.h` 内核头文件中，当量化 scale 尾轴为 1 时，原来错误地使用了 `Mul`（乘法），现统一修正为 `Div`（除法），以确保反量化/量化的数值计算正确。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`SwigluSingleYWithQuantScale` 函数**: 将 `quantIsOne` 分支中的 `Mul(vreg15, vreg15, vreg17, mask)` 修正为 `Div(vreg15, vreg15, vreg17, mask)`，使量化时正确地除以 scale 而非乘以 scale。\n- **`SwigluV2SingleYWithQuantScale` 函数**: 将量化 scale 尾轴为 1 分支中的 `Mul(vreg6, vreg6, vregQuantScale, mask)` 修正为 `Div(vreg6, vreg6, vregQuantScale, mask)`，与尾轴不为 1 分支的除法逻辑保持一致。\n- **`StaticQuantWithOne` 函数**: 将 `Mul(vreg0, vreg0, vregQuantScale, mask)` 修正为 `Div(vreg0, vreg0, vregQuantScale, mask)`，修复静态量化中 scale=1 时的运算符号错误。\n- **`StaticQuantWithQuantOffsetOne` 函数**: 将量化偏移分支中的乘法 `Mul(vreg0, vreg0, vregQuantScale, mask)` 修正为 `Div(vreg0, vreg0, vregQuantScale, mask)`，确保带偏移的量化计算正确。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-27T22:03:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-27T22:08:16+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181933660,"discussion_id":"f76543bc276300836b46903a7963a26f1ae27a2f","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n现在我已经完整审查了所有变更。让我做最终确认：没有更多需要报告的问题。\n\n---\n\n## 审查总结\n\n**已审查的文件**：\n- `quant/dequant_swiglu_quant/op_kernel/arch35/dequant_swiglu_quant_common.h` — 发现 2 个问题\n\n**发现统计**：\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P1     | 1    |\n| P3     | 1    |\n\n**总体风险评估：中高风险**\n\n核心问题是 `SwigluV2SingleYWithQuantScale` 函数中，该 PR 将主循环体的 `Mul` 改为 `Div`（修复量化计算错误），但遗漏了尾块（tail block）中同模板分支的同步修改。尾块在每次调用中都会执行一次，导致当 `HasQuantScale=true` 且 `quantIsOne=true` 时，尾块元素的计算结果与主循环元素不一致（一个乘 scale，一个除 scale），产生数值错误。建议在合入前修复此遗漏。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 1 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 0 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-27T22:03:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-27T22:08:58+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181933683,"discussion_id":"b72a50b873410062774ab2b447686b1fd8757e9f","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n cheng-ziyang2, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-27T22:03:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-27T22:03:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181933685,"discussion_id":"e5ca522c7158b093ff9e7060755be8a23a8b4810","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| quant | ✅ [*王星*](https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001), [*陈琦*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*王星*](https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n cheng-ziyang2, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-27T22:03:47+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-31T09:26:25+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181934421,"discussion_id":"17c22af2e6eaf6f9f9e9f94436d810bf9a4b7b6b","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n该 diff 将 `SwigluV2SingleYWithQuantScale` 主循环体（第 317 行）中 `quantIsOne=true` 分支的 `Mul` 改为 `Div`，但尾块处理（第 367 行）中同模板参数 `quantIsOne=true` 分支仍使用 `Mul`。\n\n主循环（第 312-323 行）：\n\n尾块（第 362-373 行）：\n\n尾块在每次调用中都会执行一次（`i = repeatTimes - 1`），因此当 `HasQuantScale=true` 且 `quantIsOne=true` 时，主迭代结果被 scale 除，而尾块结果被 scale 乘，产生数值错误。\n\n**建议**：将第 367 行的 `Mul` 改为 `Div`，与主循环第 317 行保持一致。\n\n```suggestion\n                AscendC::MicroAPI::Div(vreg6, vreg6, vregQuantScale, tailMask);\n```\n","created_at":"2026-07-27T22:08:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-31T09:26:31+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f6861